      "title": "Troubleshooting Self-Service Hub UI Rendering and Search Defects",
      "content_summary": "Addresses common functional defects in the Self-Service Hub, including blank screens, broken sorting/filtering, and incorrect search results. These issues often stem from race conditions or stale cache states.",
      "content_body": "When users report blank screens or UI elements failing to render, first check for recent updates to the Status Page or Self-Service Hub that might introduce race conditions. Incorrect search results or broken filtering are frequently caused by stale cache data; advise the user to clear their browser cache and retry. If the issue persists after cache clearing, verify if the behavior matches known product limitations documented in the release notes. For suspected race conditions, attempt to reproduce the issue in a private browsing window to rule out extension conflicts. If confirmed as a new functional defect not listed in known limitations, escalate to engineering with detailed reproduction steps."
